  "releaseNotes": "v1.8.0-beta: Set Operations (UNION, INTERSECT, EXCEPT) - Added Union(), UnionAll(), Intersect(), Except() methods for combining query results. Supports chaining and all execution methods (ToListAsync, CountAsync, AnyAsync, FirstOrDefaultAsync). Automatic subquery wrapping for ORDER BY/LIMIT/OFFSET. 19 new unit tests + 8 integration tests. v1.7.0: Distinct() and Contains()/IN clause. v1.6.0: Join Operations. 183 total tests passing.",
